  "summary": "libgit2 vulnerability",
  "details": "It was discovered that libgit2 incorrectly handled IP address\nSubjectAltName verification in TLS certificate validation. A remote\nattacker with a CA-trusted certificate could possibly use this issue\nto perform a machine-in-the-middle attack, leading to the exposure\nof sensitive information.",
